{"v":2,"catch":"您通往世界卡丁車賽的入場券！","desc":"「Go Kart Mania」是終極的卡丁車賽遊戲，將刺激的賽車體驗直接帶到您的Nintendo Switch™上。\n\n在歐洲、中國和澳洲的標誌性地點中，穿越36條獨特且具有挑戰性的賽道，每個地點都提供不同的賽車體驗。\n\n自定義您的卡丁車來智取對手。\n\n參與世界各地的激動人心的比賽，或者獨自快速賽跑，成為卡丁車傳奇。\n\n「Go Kart Mania」是您進入高速刺激和冒險世界的門票。\n\n不要錯過 - 為了一段難忘的賽車旅程啟動您的引擎吧！","publisher":"Baltoro Minis","release":"2024-03-28","genres":["競賽"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","韓文","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/afbd9efc624e47c36b6241bbea90817735a837bdec526c1724f05bc1ed550531.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b3bb9486bd000a0d0393248e883ec887e65532bd63f23fec45aa6759c49dd963.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed18e76173bbc63e07ae39bbaed6d7d55c8a52c9fff3be8e4e63acecba8bbbc4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a72ee3dd7d6629c561c044db6974cb532f0ed97b3128502ad635d567391d0a88.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c70c7df725015ac293800cecde7beb81960630fd9cf6f4b9e9278d5988f1552.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/08d29876cfcb267e1d4020a2c7bc4cf3ea02818538b1e9b0162ae417fc5dafff.jpg"],"dlc":[{"id":"70050000051203","name":"Go Kart Mania Livery Pack #1","img":"8fcc509535dbe59c60ab01bd8cb0a56e36c483b30d8f4c8f7884c14f7163b2e0","date":"2024-08-22","mem":false},{"id":"70050000051204","name":"Go Kart Mania Livery Pack #2","img":"bb2d780834d88b0b9ff5a7d6137ff4e7694a7ef3a9177cd09cd353158ce0122e","date":"2024-08-22","mem":false},{"id":"70050000051205","name":"Go Kart Mania Livery Pack #3","img":"e80b8c74700ea3da5a8faca4a2a1d2d6ebb2ea0fdf0c79d8ef6810a35fa8ecac","date":"2024-08-22","mem":false}],"dlcTotal":4,"titleId":"01004c301e77e000"}